{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112640","id":2998826787,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6yvncj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112640.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112640/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112640/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112640/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b2b3134e62d73d398b5bd3daa329f3877b61c79a","number":112640,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix crashes on Adreno 5XX GPUs when scenes become occluded","user":{"login":"VivianZhoulw","id":11807640,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODA3NjQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11807640?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw","html_url":"https://github.com/VivianZhoulw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VivianZhoulw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Testing revealed that Android devices with Adreno 5XX GPUs (confirmed on Android 9 and 10, other versions unknown) experience application crashes when scenes containing shaders become invisible relative to the screen (e.g., when the UI is occluded or the app is backgrounded).\r\n\r\nThe root cause is shader object lifecycle corruption when the EGL context is preserved across surface destroy/create cycles, which occurs when the rendering surface is temporarily destroyed while the context remains active.\r\n\r\nThis commit implements the following workarounds:\r\n\r\n- OpenGL ES path: Disable EGL context preservation for Adreno 5XX GPUs to force full context recreation, preventing shader object corruption.\r\n\r\n- Vulkan path: Force fallback to OpenGL3 rendering for Adreno 5XX GPUs, as these devices have critical Vulkan driver bugs that cause crashes in FinalizeDescriptors when handling descriptor sets for occluded UI elements.\r\n\r\n- Vulkan thread: Force thread restart on surface loss for problematic Adreno GPUs to ensure clean state recovery.\r\n\r\nAffected SoCs include Snapdragon 625 (Adreno 506), Snapdragon 430/435 (Adreno 505), Snapdragon 425 (Adreno 505), Snapdragon 652/653/650 (Adreno 510), and Snapdragon 660/636 (Adreno 509/512).\r\n\r\nTesting confirms that crashes no longer occur with these workarounds in place.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-11T12:11:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T23:00:17Z","closed_at":"2026-01-06T22:59:59Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"VivianZhoulw:master","ref":"mas